Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Trikotnik in v\[CHacek]rtana ter o\[CHacek]rtana kro\[ZHacek]nica", \
"Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990017854216402*^9, 3.9900178888253593`*^9}, 
   3.990019621229845*^9},ExpressionUUID->"ffdd3684-dd23-ce4a-80fd-\
7d3351211884"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Uvod", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9900179152002525`*^9, 3.990017917106312*^9}, 
   3.990019627091755*^9},ExpressionUUID->"8f934a9e-ea12-9949-a279-\
46d8891c76ad"],

Cell["\<\
V projektni nalogi so obravnavani objekti to\[CHacek]ka, daljica in trikotnik.
Za te objekte so implementirane funkcije za dolo\[CHacek]anje osnovnih \
lastnosti
ter njihov grafi\[CHacek]ni prikaz v dveh dimenzijah.
Posebna pozornost je namenjena v\[CHacek]rtani in o\[CHacek]rtani \
kro\[ZHacek]nici trikotnika.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990018083041359*^9, 
  3.990018085466425*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"86d80208-4bd5-5947-a3ae-\
cdde10f304aa"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Objekt To\[CHacek]ka", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990017924012535*^9, 3.9900179352322426`*^9}, 
   3.9900196372121773`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"3e4f53b8-471c-d743-9af0-\
949018e94510"],

Cell["\<\
To\[CHacek]ka predstavlja osnovni geometrijski objekt v ravnini. \
Dolo\[CHacek]ena je z dvema koordinatama (x, y), ki dolo\[CHacek]ata njen \
polo\[ZHacek]aj v koordinatnem sistemu.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990018992699991*^9, 3.9900190326219788`*^9}, {
  3.9900199323560524`*^9, 
  3.990019937075201*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"caac70cd-9ee9-9d49-bc8b-\
7128aa71dcd1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Definicija objekta", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990019883026842*^9, 
  3.9900199184971313`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7af95a3e-f32a-824f-8022-\
b25b713ee922"],

Cell["\<\
To\[CHacek]ka je v projektu predstavljena z objektom Tocka[x, y], kjer x in y \
sta koordinati to\[CHacek]ke v ravnini.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.990019947918501*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f4423705-4a68-c441-bff4-\
948fe194216c"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
  RowBox[{"Tocka", ",", "Koordinate"}], "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Koordinate", "[", 
   RowBox[{"Tocka", "[", 
    RowBox[{"x_", ",", "y_"}], "]"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"x", ",", "y"}], "}"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99001904707646*^9, 3.9900190495210304`*^9}, 
   3.9900202841533623`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c143812b-c327-3944-ae74-3beaea6b185e"]
}, Open  ]],

